  "title": "Carol's Baked Potato Soup",
  "description": "This baked potato soup recipe with Cheddar cheese, green onions, crumbled bacon, and sour cream is easy to make, rich in flavor, and delicious!",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
